            <p>Welcome to Age Calculator, your trusted tool for calculating exact age across multiple date systems. We provide accurate and instant age calculations for personal, educational, and professional use.</p>

            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Our mission is to make age calculation simple, accurate, and accessible for everyone. Whether you need to calculate your exact age in years, months, days, hours, minutes, or seconds, our tool delivers precise results instantly.</p>

            <h2>What We Offer</h2>
            <ul>
