                <li><strong>Multiple Time Units</strong> — View your age in years, months, weeks, days, hours, minutes, seconds, and milliseconds.</li>
                <li><strong>Calendar View</strong> — Visualize your birth month and current month with highlighted dates.</li>
                <li><strong>Download Results</strong> — Save your age calculation results as an HTML file for future reference.</li>
                <li><strong>Cultural Age Systems</strong> — Learn about how age is counted differently across various cultures worldwide.</li>
